sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Người học
  participant UI as React client
  participant API as FastAPI /turn
  participant Q as Quota + usage ledger
  participant ASR as ASR adapter
  participant LLM as LLM adapter
  participant TTS as TTS adapter
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>UI: Gửi text hoặc chủ động ghi âm
  UI->>API: POST /turn + request_id + consent state
  API->>Q: Reserve quota (idempotent)
  alt Quota hết
    Q-->>API: Reject reservation
    API-->>UI: 429 + quota remaining/reset
  else Được phép
    Q-->>API: Reservation ID
    opt Voice input
      API->>ASR: Audio stream, no persistent audio storage
      ASR-->>API: Transcript + confidence metadata
    end
    alt Transcript rỗng / không chắc
      API-->>UI: status=uncertain, ask to retry or text mode
    else Input usable
      API->>DB: Load approved objectives/context
      API->>LLM: Structured request; <= 2 corrections
      LLM-->>API: Schema-constrained reply
      opt User requested audio response
        API->>TTS: Synthesize reply
        TTS-->>API: Ephemeral audio response
      end
      API->>DB: Store allowed conversation fields + usage ledger
      API-->>UI: reply, corrections, target_words_used, usage
    end
  end
